    <details class="help-item" id="reference-photos">
        <summary>What is a reference photo?</summary>
        <p>
            A photo that isn't of your own plant, like the seller's listing or the plant fully grown. It stays
            out of the history and is never the cover, so it doesn't count as a photo of the plant, and it is
            left out of shared pages, the time-lapse and your year. It is kept as a record of what you bought,
            in case a label goes missing. Add one with <em>Add a reference photo</em> under <em>Details</em>, or
            open a photo and tap <em>Move to reference</em>. Reference photos show in a row under the history,
            and <em>Move to history</em> puts one back where it was.
        </p>
